# Matrix 配置模板

```json
{
  "name": "matrix",
  "description": "Matrix 协议配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "matrix",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "homeserver": "https://matrix.org",
    "user": "@bot:matrix.org",
    "password": "${MATRIX_PASSWORD}",
    "access_token": "${MATRIX_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "device_id": "CLAWBOT001",
    "room_alias": "#clawbot:matrix.org"
  },
  "features": [
    "私聊消息",
    "群聊消息",
    "富文本支持",
    "文件传输"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 注册 Matrix 用户或创建应用服务",
    "2. 安装 matrix-commander: pip install matrix-commander",
    "3. 配置环境变量",
    "4. 测试连接"
  ],
  "envVars": {
    "MATRIX_HOMESERVER": "Matrix 服务器地址",
    "MATRIX_USER": "用户 ID",
    "MATRIX_PASSWORD": "密码或 access_token"
  }
}
```

## 使用示例

```python
import matrix_commander

bot = matrix_commander.MatrixCommander()
bot.send("Hello from ClawBot!")
```

## 文件位置
`templates/messaging/matrix.json`
